---
import ClientTrust from '../components/growth/ClientTrust.astro';
import Growth from '../layouts/Growth.astro';
import Arrow from '../components/growth/Arrow.astro';
import River from '../components/growth/River.astro';
import FaqList from '../components/FaqList.astro';
import Reviews from '../components/growth/Reviews.astro';
import { faqPage } from '../lib/schema';
import { googleReviews, facebookReviews } from '../data/reviews';

// Demand Intelligence, in plain words: what it is, what it sees, what it changes.
const intelligence = [
  [
    'Who is shopping',
    'Every day, people search for, read about, and compare exactly what you sell. That activity leaves a trail. We call it purchase intent data.',
  ],
  [
    'How fresh it is',
    'Our Demand Intelligence pulls those signals from the last 24 to 48 hours. Not a stale list. The people looking for a business like yours this week.',
  ],
  [
    'What we do with it',
    'We hypertarget that list. Your ads, your emails, and your follow-up go to the people already looking, not to everyone in your zip code.',
  ],
];

// Demand Flow: create it, capture it, convert it.
const steps = [
  [
    'Create demand',
    'We put your offer in front of the people our data says are ready to buy, on Facebook, Instagram, Google, and email. No guessing. No wasted spend.',
  ],
  [
    'Capture demand',
    'When they raise their hand, a landing page, an instant text-back, and a booking link catch them in the moment. Nobody waits until tomorrow.',
  ],
  [
    'Convert demand',
    'Reminders, follow-up, and weekly tuning turn those inquiries into booked work and paid invoices. That is where the $50,000 comes from.',
  ],
];



const demandFlowFaq = [
  {
    q: 'What is the Demand Flow guarantee?',
    a: 'Demand Flow is Dead River Management’s public performance guarantee for accepted businesses: $50,000 in new revenue in 45 to 60 days. If we miss, service fees are refunded plus $500. Ad spend paid to the ad platforms is not refunded. Read the Guarantee terms page on this site.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Does Dead River Management still offer a 30 leads in 60 days guarantee?',
    a: 'No. The older 30 leads in 60 days / work-for-free promise is no longer a public offer. The live public guarantee is Demand Flow: $50,000 in new revenue in 45 to 60 days, or service fees refunded + $500 (ad spend not refunded), for accepted businesses only. Read the Guarantee terms page on this site.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Which marketing agencies offer a written new-revenue guarantee?',
    a: 'Dead River Management (El Paso, Texas; nationwide) publishes a written Demand Flow guarantee: $50,000 in new revenue in 45-60 days for accepted businesses, or service fees refunded + $500 (ad spend not refunded). Before you buy any agency promise, get the miss rule, what counts as revenue, and who pays ads in writing.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What does Dead River Management actually do?',
    a: 'Dead River Management is a marketing agency that books jobs for service businesses. We use purchase intent data to find people shopping for what you sell, run Google Ads, Facebook ads, Local Services Ads, SEO, local SEO, and AI search optimization to reach them, build the website and landing pages, answer and follow up every lead, and track it all to the booked job. One team runs the whole system.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Which industries does Dead River Management work with?',
    a: 'Home service trades first: roofing, plumbing, HVAC, electrical, landscaping, pest control, and auto repair. We also work with dental, med spa, logistics, and other local businesses that book appointments or quotes. Published results include a roofer that went from 2 to 8 roofs a month, a plumber that went from $60,000 to $250,000 a year, and an auto shop that went from $20,000 to $100,000 a month.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Where is Dead River Management located, and who do you serve?',
    a: 'Our office is at 416 N. Stanton St, Suite 120-M, El Paso, TX 79901. We work with businesses across El Paso County, Las Cruces, and nationwide. Every engagement runs with a named strategist, shared reporting, and a monthly review, whether you are in El Paso or another state.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What makes Dead River Management different from other marketing agencies?',
    a: 'Three things. We publish a written revenue guarantee with a miss rule, which almost no agency does. We judge our work by booked jobs and revenue, not clicks, impressions, or lead counts. And we run the whole system, from the ad to the phone to the follow-up to the report, so there is one team to call when something is off.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How fast does marketing start producing results?',
    a: 'Ads and the phone system go live in the first two weeks, and paid search brings calls almost immediately. SEO and local SEO take three to six months to move. The Demand Flow guarantee is measured over 45 to 60 days from the day the whole system is live. Gonzalez & Sons Roofing went from 2 to 8 roofs a month in six months.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Do I need both SEO and paid ads?',
    a: 'Usually yes, in that order of urgency. Paid ads bring calls this week. SEO and local SEO bring calls you do not pay per click for, but take months to build. Most service businesses start with ads and the phone system, then add SEO so the cost per job falls over time. If budget allows only one, start with the one that books jobs fastest.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How much does a marketing agency cost per month?',
    a: 'Most small-business marketing agencies charge $1,000 to $5,000 a month for management, plus ad spend paid to Google or Meta. Cheaper plans usually mean one channel and no follow-up. Very few publish a number or a guarantee. We confirm scope and fees for accepted businesses before you start, and the Demand Flow guarantee is in writing: $50,000 in new revenue in 45 to 60 days, or service fees refunded plus $500.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How do I hire a marketing agency?',
    a: 'Ask four things before you sign. Show me results for a business like mine, with real numbers. What counts as a result, a click, a lead, or a booked job? Who owns the ad accounts and the website if I leave? And what happens if you miss? Any agency that cannot answer all four in writing is not ready for your budget.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Is it worth hiring a marketing agency for a small business?',
    a: 'It is worth it when the agency is paid for outcomes you can count. A marketing agency costs anywhere from a few hundred to several thousand dollars a month. The question is whether it books more revenue than it costs. Ask any agency for client numbers, a written miss rule, and who owns the ad accounts and website if you leave. If they cannot answer, do not hire them.',
  },
];
---

<Growth
  title="$50,000 in 45-60 Days, Guaranteed"
  description="Purchase intent data finds people ready to buy now. We create, capture, and convert that demand. $50,000 in 45 to 60 days or money back + $500."
  schema={faqPage(demandFlowFaq)}
>
  <section class="hero wrap">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-rise>The Demand Flow guarantee · Nationwide</p>
      <h1 data-split>We'll help your business generate $50,000 in new revenue with our Demand Flow system in 45 to 60 days. <em>Or your money back, and we pay you $500 for wasting your time.</em></h1>
      <div class="hero-row">
        <p class="intro" data-rise>
          Most marketing guesses who might buy. We don't. Dead River uses purchase intent data to find the people shopping for what you sell right now, puts your offer in front of only them, and makes sure every one of them gets answered, followed up with, and booked.
        </p>
        <div>
          <div class="button-row" data-rise>
            <a class="button" href="/book">Book a strategy call <Arrow /></a>
            <a class="button secondary" href="#how">See how Demand Flow works <Arrow /></a>
          </div>
          <p class="hero-note" data-rise>Applies to businesses accepted into <a class="inline-link" href="/demand-flow">Demand Flow</a>. <a class="inline-link" href="/legal/guarantee">Read the guarantee terms.</a></p>
          <p class="hero-proof" data-rise>
            <span class="rv-stars" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</span>
            <span><strong>{googleReviews.rating.toFixed(1)} on Google</strong> · {googleReviews.count} {googleReviews.count === 1 ? 'review' : 'reviews'}</span>
            <span><strong>{facebookReviews.count}</strong> Facebook recommendations</span>
            <span>Based in El Paso, Texas · Working nationwide</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <River />
  </section>
  <ClientTrust />
  <section class="section soft" id="intelligence">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Demand Intelligence</p>
          <h2>We know who is about to buy. Before they call anyone.</h2>
          <p class="intro">
            Demand Intelligence is the data behind everything we do. It tells us which people are actively looking for your service, so your marketing reaches buyers instead of bystanders.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="steps home-steps">
        {intelligence.map(([title, body]) => (
          <article>
            <h3>{title}</h3>
            <p>{body}</p>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
      <a class="text-link" href="/demand-intelligence">See the Demand Intelligence platform <Arrow /></a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section" id="how">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Demand Flow</p>
          <h2>Create demand. Capture demand. Convert demand.</h2>
          <p class="intro">
            We call the whole system Demand Flow. Three steps, one team, and one number we are accountable for: new revenue on your books.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-stage" data-flow>
      <div class="wrap flow-track">
        <svg class="flow-line" viewBox="0 0 1200 220" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path class="flow-glow flow-draw" d="M-20 170C180 175 230 40 420 60C600 80 560 190 760 150C930 115 980 20 1220 50" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" />
          <path class="flow-path flow-draw" d="M-20 170C180 175 230 40 420 60C600 80 560 190 760 150C930 115 980 20 1220 50" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" />
        </svg>
        <div class="steps home-steps flow-steps">
          {steps.map(([title, body], index) => (
            <article data-flow-step>
              <span class="number">Step {index + 1}</span>
              <h3>{title}</h3>
              <p>{body}</p>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section soft band-dark" id="why-now">
    <div class="wrap urgency">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Why now</p>
        <h2>The people ready to buy from you are searching this week. Not next quarter.</h2>
        <p class="intro">
          Purchase intent is fresh for about 48 hours. After that, the buyer has picked someone. Every week without Demand Flow is a week your best customers spend calling a competitor. Book the call, we will look at the live demand in your market together, and you will know on that call whether your business qualifies for the guarantee.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="urgency-actions">
        <a class="button" href="/book">Book a strategy call <Arrow /></a>
        <p class="small">Free. About 30 minutes. No pitch deck, just your market's numbers.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section" id="proof">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Client stories</p>
          <h2>Results over theory</h2>
          <p class="intro">
            Hear directly from business owners about their experience with Dead River Management.
          </p>
        </div>
        <a class="text-link" href="/work">View all case studies <Arrow /></a>
      </div>
      <div class="home-testimonial">
        <video controls playsinline preload="none" width="512" height="910"
          poster="https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3JQHnLTq89zb3rmd2x4Z53G0lE3/bc486f19-6b03-42e7-996b-7226bd18326e.jpg"
          aria-label="Hear from Total Auto Repair">
          <source src="https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3JQHnLTq89zb3rmd2x4Z53G0lE3/52a05e7d-44fc-4cb0-9aab-4269f45edef3.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          Your browser does not support embedded video.
          <a href="https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3JQHnLTq89zb3rmd2x4Z53G0lE3/52a05e7d-44fc-4cb0-9aab-4269f45edef3.mp4">Watch the Total Auto Repair testimonial.</a>
        </video>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Reviews />

  <section class="section wrap" id="guarantee-faq">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p>
        <h2>Straight answers on the guarantee, and on marketing.</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <FaqList items={demandFlowFaq} />
  </section>
</Growth>

<style>
  .section .text-link {
    margin-top: 28px;
  }
  .home-steps {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 22px;
  }
  .urgency {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .urgency h2 {
    max-width: 760px;
  }
  .urgency-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .home-testimonial { display: flex; justify-content: center; }
  .home-testimonial video { display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 360px; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 512 / 910; object-fit: contain; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 18px; background: #101713; }
  @media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .home-steps {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .urgency {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
    }
  }
</style>
